Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[Cell["\t", "ExampleDelimiter"], $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleDelimiter"], Cell[TextData[{"A list ", Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"{", RowBox[{StyleBox["ns", "TI"], ",", " ", StyleBox["name", "TI"]}], "}"}]], "InlineFormula"], " gives two keys, not one namespaced key:"}], "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData["use=XMLElement[\"use\",{{\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\",\"href\"}->\"#icon\"},{}];
{XMLMatchQ[use,XMLPattern[\"use\",{\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\",\"href\"}]],XMLMatchQ[use,XMLPattern[\"use\",{{\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\",\"href\"}}]]}"], "Input"],

