Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[Cell["\t", "ExampleDelimiter"], $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleDelimiter"], Cell[TextData[{"A string pattern cannot appear anywhere in an ", Cell[BoxData[ButtonBox["XMLPattern", BaseStyle -> "Link", ButtonData -> "paclet:MaximilienTirard/HTMLPatterns/ref/XMLPattern"]], "InlineFormula"], ":"}], "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData["XMLMatchQ[XMLElement[\"div\",{\"class\"->\"col-6\"},{}],XMLPattern[\"div\",\"classList\"->{\"col-\"~~__}]]"], "Input"],

