Cell[CellGroupData[{Cell[BoxData[InterpretationBox[Cell["\t", "ExampleDelimiter"], $Line = 0; Null]], "ExampleDelimiter"], Cell["A key can have only one constraint:", "ExampleText"], Cell[BoxData["XMLMatchQ[XMLElement[\"li\",{\"class\"->\"item active\"},{}],XMLPattern[\"li\",{\"classList\"->\"item\",\"classList\"->\"active\"}]]"], "Input"],

